# Software industry mapping for FMS
@prefix sw: <https://ecosystemcode.com/ontology/fms/software#> .
@prefix legacy: <https://example.com/legacy/software#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

legacy:deferred_revenue_journal owl:equivalentClass sw:DeferredRevenueJournal .
legacy:deferred_revenue_journal_id rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:deferredRevenueJournalId .
legacy:subscription_customer_invoice owl:equivalentClass sw:SubscriptionCustomerInvoice .
legacy:subscription_customer_invoice_id rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:subscriptionCustomerInvoiceId .
legacy:recognises_subscription_invoice rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:recognisesSubscriptionInvoice .
